{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "maibot-community.mai-love",
  "name": "麦麦恋人",
  "version": "2.4.0",
  "description": "私聊专用虚拟恋人插件，会主动找你聊天。基于麦麦的独立日程生活，通过 planner 自主决策什么时候说话、说什么，配合好感度系统调节语气温度。v2.4.0: 恋人电脑联动（[cateye] 开启后想念/早晚安触发时经 cateye.connect-hub 截屏并由视觉模型转述用户在干什么，未连接则告知「电脑没开」）；LLM 调用日志（记录插件发起的模型请求回复/事件/时间，默认保留 3 天，/mai_llm_log 合并转发查看，新增 send.forward 能力）。",
  "author": {
    "name": "octmicy",
    "url": "https://github.com/octmicy/Mai_love"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/octmicy/Mai_love",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/octmicy/Mai_love",
    "documentation": "https://docs.mai-mai.org"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.2.3",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.6.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "type": "python_package",
      "name": "httpx",
      "version_spec": ">=0.24.0"
    }
  ],
  "plugin_type": "tool",
  "capabilities": [
    "send.text",
    "chat.get_stream_by_user_id",
    "chat.get_private_streams",
    "llm.generate",
    "maisaka.proactive.trigger",
    "config.get",
    "api.call",
    "send.forward"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN",
    "supported_locales": [
      "zh-CN",
      "en-US"
    ]
  }
}
